  "known_limits": "Upper balconies partly enclosed by successive residents. Ground-level cage and window finishes differ between two years. No opposite rear elevation, interior plan or proof that every even number in the gazette refers to this block. Full width belongs to parcel, not to scope of deposited photo controls."
